{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅れちゃってごめんなさいっ＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、悪天候の中、\n会いにきてくださったみなさま\n本当に有難うございました(｡>ω<｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変だったよね...ホントにごめんね、(´ ; _ ; ｀)\n大丈夫だったかなぁー(ノω・、)心配です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぞ寒かったでしょう...(´・・｀)\n少しはさゆにゃんのお手てで、\nあったかくなってくれてたら\n嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったまったかなぁ？(  *^_^*  )照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは、みなさんとお話できて\nとーっても嬉しかったし、楽しかったです！\n寒さもふきとんじゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、大好きなドーナツを食べたので\n元気100倍でした！＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好物のエサを与えられると\n元気になる単純な私..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットボトルの飲み物を飲みきって、\n達成感にひたる嬉しそうなにゃんさゆ。\n片手にはドーナツ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、金運一位おめでとう～！って\n言ってくれてありがとうー(丿^ω^ヽ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにも、ぎゅぅーってして\n金運、伝えたよっｐ(*^-^*)ｑ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、お出かけするときは、\nお買い物じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花や芸術が好きだから、\n庭園とか美術館にしか行かないの。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうとこでほっこりしてる\nゆっくりな時間が好き  ♪♪\nあとは、空とかがすっごく好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういうものに、何よりも、\n価値を感じます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物を大切にしたいから新しい物も\nぽんぽん買おうとしなくて\n物欲もあんまりないんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイなお花とか木とか\n空とか景色とか空気なら\nこの世界にたくさんほしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれかお願いします(>_<)\nゴセイナイトぉぉお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪の写真とか、私服とかは\nまた別でのっけるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若様ー(*pωq*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゅんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてこったあ！\nかっこよすぎふっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかさまーーー(｀・д´・)ぅぉぉおおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新成人のみなさん、おめでとうございます ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが幸せでありますようにっ*:･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん、みさみさ、まいやん、ななみんも、おめでとー＼(^o^)／\n４人とも本当にダイスキ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会が終わったあと、\nケーキでお祝いしました꒰๑͒•௰•๑͒꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ4人も、大人の仲間入りだねっ(｡>ω<｡)\n新しい世界が開けますよーに♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お父さん、お母さんへ感謝の気持ちを\n忘れることなく、大きく飛躍される\nことを祈っています"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/01/16/7094740/0017.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}